  Also identical to the installed copy at
  /usr/share/wayland-protocols/stable/xdg-shell/xdg-shell.xml
  SHA256: 7ba7f9c8473deee674cb1f154a18abd0bb0cc072604fc055b0c15e459fc4c7df
